Backend step by step

1. Create datebase " Go to terminal and type php artisan make:migration blotter "
2. Go to migration file and add the fields you want
3. Go to model and add the fillable fields
4. Go to controller and create the store function
5. Go to api.php and create the api resource

6. put useform <form></form> in all forms or registration form
7. Go to services and Create Services "position-service.js"
8. Go to api.php then create api "Route::resource('positions', PositionController::class);"
9. Go to Controller and create store function

public function store(Request $request)
{
Position::create($request->all());
return response()->json(['message' => 'Barangay information created successfully'], 200);
}

10. Then you go to your UI for addPostion then put this

const submitForm = async (data) => {
await create_positions_service(data);
reset();
onClose();
};

