---how to show Data from the database---

1. Go to services and create function for fetching data
export const fetch_positions_service = async () => {
const response = await axios.get('/api/positions');
return response.data;
};
2.create slice and thunk.(Just copy from other slice and thunk and change the name)
3. Go to store.js and add the slice
4 Go to your UI and use useEffect add thunk fetch data - Always put the useEffect to the page or general page 
useEffect(() => {
        store.dispatch(get_barangay_residents_thunk());
    }, []);
5. go to your UI and use useSelector to get the data from the store - Your TablePage
